@startuml
title Monthly Momentum — Same-Day 12-Cycle Rollover

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
  BorderColor #17365D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF2CC
  DiamondBorderColor #BF9000
  FontColor #17365D
}

start
:Load adjusted daily OHLCV;
:Load point-in-time index membership;
:Apply 60-day membership rule\nand approved spin-off exceptions;
:Calculate declared momentum returns\nand 21-session volatility;
:On the configured monthly session,\nrank only eligible members;
:Select top N and buy at session open;

if (Stop loss before cycle 12?) then (yes)
  :Sell using conservative stop/gap rule;
  :Calculate net realized tax reserve;
  :Spread after-tax proceeds over\nremaining scheduled monthly cycles;
else (no)
  :At the 12th subsequent monthly session,\nsell mature tranche at the open;
  :Calculate net realized tax reserve;
  :Make after-tax proceeds available\nimmediately on the same session;
endif

:Add scheduled early-exit installment;
:Buy the new selected stock(s)\nat the same session open;
:Persist trades, cash ledger,\nconfiguration metrics, ROI, and XIRR;
stop

note right
No brokerage-settlement delay is modeled.
Point-in-time membership is applied at
both signal and execution.
The +100%/+60% stepwise profit trailing
rule is disabled for this experiment.
end note
@enduml
